/home/sat/mcrl-v025-datepool-ws/DATEPOOL-ADJUDICATION-2026-09-09.md:24:**Date overlap is a plausible generalisation risk, not demonstrated date memorisation.** The declared learner is a supervised surrogate trained by pairwise zero-bootstrap regression, with a set-conditioned interaction head; it is not a table indexed by calendar date. Q1 observes physical margins, power, occupancy, activation, off-axis angle and history. The executable [C2 encoding](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-codex-ws-engine/src/mcrl/physics_v025/state_v025.py:19) contains physical and forecast fields, with no raw date or NORAD identifier. The inherited [action-shared network](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-codex-ws-engine/src/mcrl/algorithms/ee_axis_action_shared.py:74) applies one scalar scorer across action rows. These properties make literal whole-date lookup less plausible than the framing implies. Inherited implementation details should not be mistaken for verification of every final successor encoder.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-datepool-ws/DATEPOOL-ADJUDICATION-2026-09-09.md:26:They do not prove invariance to date. The successor C3 contract includes coalition resource relations and pairwise cross gains, allowing rich geometric fingerprints. A network can overfit familiar local configurations, rare interaction patterns, occupancy regimes or decision boundaries without identifying the date. Repeated epochs over the same source batches do not create new environmental diversity. General neural-network memorisation results establish capacity, not an overfitting magnitude for this particular policy. See [C3 feature amendment](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-codex-ws-engine/.scratch/multi-catfish-v025-physics-successor/V025-STAGES-6-8-CONTRACT-v1.2-AMENDMENT-2026-09-09.md:6) and [Zhang et al., ICLR 2017](https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.03530).
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-datepool-ws/DATEPOOL-ADJUDICATION-2026-09-09.md:30:The 8,044-to-10,746 increase is a real reason to avoid an accidental early-versus-late comparison. It does **not** imply a 34% increase in neural input size, local interference or coordination benefit. The [action contract](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-codex-ws-engine/src/mcrl/env/action_contract.py:40) fixes four satellite slots times seven beam slots, or 28 actions; [hardware inventory](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-codex-ws-engine/src/mcrl/physics_v025/provider_legacy.py:304) comes from actual legal actions. Measure selected/visible satellites, mask cardinality, elevation, power requirements, shared-resource relations and energy by era. Global archive counts are a proxy for those changes, not their measurement. Structured-validation research likewise warns that blocking can introduce unwanted extrapolation along a changing covariate distribution; the split must match the intended claim. [Roberts et al., Ecography 2017](https://www.biom.uni-freiburg.de/mitarbeiter/dormann/roberts-et-al-2017-ecography.pdf/at_download/file).
